  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> be the sum of the coefficients of the odd powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>99</mn></msup></math>. Let a be the middle term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>200</mn></msup></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>99</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>200</mn></mmultiscripts><mi>K</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi></msup><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> are odd numbers,&nbsp;then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>51</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>51</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>99</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>101</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>51</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>101</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
